<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1830385" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Ngenali Wilangan Asli lan Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id2325869">Sinau aljabar kuwi kaya sinau basa. Wiwiti saka tembung-tembung dhasar, banjur tambahna sithik-sithik. Kudu kerep latihan supaya tembung-tembung kuwi dadi gampang. Saya kerep dienggo, saya kulina.</para>
<para id="fs-id2269442">Ing aljabar, wilangan lan tandha dienggo nyatakake tembung lan gagasan. Ayo wiwit saka wilangan. Sing paling dhasar yaiku wilangan sing dienggo ngetung barang: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>…</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan sateruse. Wilangan iki jenenge <term id="term-00001">wilangan asli</term>. Tandha “…” jenenge elipsis. Tegese “lan sateruse”: pola kuwi terus, ora ana enteke. Wilangan kanggo ngetung iki uga diarani wilangan natural.</para>
<note id="fs-id2631065">
<title>Wilangan Asli</title>
<para id="fs-id1565524">Wilangan asli wiwit saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan terus sateruse.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1601874" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id2741297">Wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah bisa digambar ing <term id="term-00002">garis wilangan</term>, kaya ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001"><media id="fs-id2316516" alt="Iki gambar garis wilangan saka 0 nganti 6, mundhake siji-siji. Panah ing ndhuwur garis sing nengen diwenehi tulisan “luwih gedhé”. Panah sing ngiwa diwenehi tulisan “luwih cilik”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Ing garis wilangan, saya nengen wilangane saya gedhé; saya ngiwa wilangane saya cilik.</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1410425">Titik sing tulisane <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> jenenge <term id="term-00003">titik wiwitan</term>. Titik-titik ing tengen <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> jarake padha lan diwenehi label wilangan asli. Yen sawijining wilangan dipasangake karo titik, wilangan kuwi jenenge <term id="term-00004">koordinat</term> titik kuwi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1383646">Panemune wilangan nol kuwi langkah gedhé ing sejarah matematika. Yen nol dilebokake bareng karo wilangan asli, ana kumpulan wilangan anyar sing jenenge <term id="term-00005">wilangan cacah</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id2606982">
<title>Wilangan Cacah</title>
<para id="fs-id1516323">Wilangan cacah kuwi wilangan asli lan nol.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2260967" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id1904853">Anggone nulis iki mandheg ing <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> nalika nulis sawetara <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">wilangan asli</term> lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">wilangan cacah</term> sing wiwitan. Yen polane durung cetha, wilangan liyane bisa ditulis maneh.</para>
<example id="fs-id1262372">
<exercise id="fs-id1398237"><problem id="fs-id3413579">
<para id="fs-id1393222">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli? <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1269630"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5.2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2564359">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<list id="fs-id2198081" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Wilangan asli wiwit saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> dudu wilangan asli. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kabeh kuwi wilangan asli.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Wilangan cacah kuwi wilangan asli lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kuwi wilangan cacah.</item></list><para id="fs-id1952631">Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5.2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dudu wilangan asli lan dudu wilangan cacah. Wilangan iki dirembug mengko.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2698269" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id3298473"><problem id="fs-id2210740">
<para id="fs-id1587799">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1363233"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>11.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>241</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2775154">
<list id="fs-id2425678" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2, 9, 241, 376</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 2, 9, 241, 376</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1906330" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1786026"><problem id="fs-id2812320">
<para id="fs-id1409646">Saka wilangan iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id2840506"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>8.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>201</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1415724">
<list id="fs-id1960220" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 7, 13, 201</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 7, 13, 201</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section>
